:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Killer Cat (Enemy)]].''
'''Killer Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked when clearing Levels 1, 3, 5 or 7 of [[Horde of Cats]]. He was added in [[Version 5.8 Update|Version 5.8]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 11.5 Update|Version 11.5]] gains increased recharge time, heavily reduced cost, [[Behemoth Slayer]], [[Immune to Surge|Surge Immunity]], greatly improved stats, and becomes [[Strong Against|Strong]] against [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemies.

