==Trivia==
*Despite there being no way to give him plus levels through normal gameplay, in the game's files Killer Cat is set to have a maximum possible level cap of 50+70.
*Killer Cat has made many cameos before his debut, first seen in [[PPT48 (Uber Rare Cat)|PPT48]], [[Gloomy Neneko (Super Rare Cat)|Witchy Neneko]], [[Red Riding Mina (Special Cat)|Red Riding Mina]], the Cats behind the door and in [[Metal Slug Collaboration Event|Metal Slug Defense]] as enemies and allies.

